     1934     put  stream macr_excel unformatted  substitute('select("r&1c&2:r&3c&4 ")' , 7 , 1 , v-row - 1 , v-col ) skip .
     1935     put  stream macr_excel unformatted 'BORDER( 0 , 7 , 7 , 7 , 7 , ,0,0,0,0,0) '  skip .
     1936     put  stream macr_excel unformatted  substitute('select("r&1c&2:r&3c&4 ")' , 7 , 2 , v-row - 1 , 2 ) skip .
