     1940     put  stream macr_excel unformatted  substitute('select("r&1c&2:r&3c&4 ")' , 7 , 4 , v-row - 1 , 4 ) skip .
     1941     put  stream macr_excel unformatted 'BORDER( 0, 0, 7, 7, 7, ,0,0,0,0,0) '  skip .
